@format 1
@id ui-event.quality-readout-lost-focus
@title Quality readout — focus lost
@section I. UI
@area UI event
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge
@event-ref cs|PSShared/PSField.cs|PSFieldSliderBuild|pReadout|LostKeyboardFocus|1
@entry input
@summary Validate and normalize a manually entered ranged quality value when editing ends.
@tag lost keyboard focus
@tag PSField
@alias owner = Cadroue.UIShell.PSShared.PSField

[input] UI event <input>
- Receive the lost keyboard focus event from the quality readout @ owner.PSFieldSliderBuild
> commit

[commit] Normalize manual quality <process>
- Parse, clamp, snap, and format the typed quality while synchronizing the slider @ owner.PSFieldSliderBuild
> output

[output] Quality committed <output>
= Valid text is normalized to the codec range and step; invalid text reverts to the current slider value.
! Code binding: cs|PSShared/PSField.cs|PSFieldSliderBuild|pReadout|LostKeyboardFocus|1
